{"id":"19.06.bzd","contentHtml":"<p>As part of my work at \"Uchtech-Profi\", I acted as the <strong>key Unity Developer</strong> on a large project dedicated to creating a complex of virtual laboratory works on <strong>Life Safety (BZD)</strong>.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>My task was to turn dry methodological instructions into interactive, functional, and methodologically correct simulators.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>Challenge</h2>\n<p>Within the framework of a large project on <strong>Life Safety (BZD)</strong>, the key task was the <strong>development of a wide range of diverse simulators</strong> from a 3D evacuation plan constructor to 2D simulation of electrical circuits and high-precision emulation of real measuring instruments.</p>\n<h2>Engineering Solution</h2>\n<p>My work covered the creation of many simulators of different types, where I was responsible for the entire implementation. Here are key examples:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>3D Simulator-Constructor (<code>Fire Safety</code>):</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Developed a simulator where the user can freely move around a 3D building and arrange equipment.</li>\n<li>Created tools such as an equipment selection menu, <strong>interactive 3D ruler</strong>, context menu for each object, and so on.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>High-Precision Emulation of Real Equipment (<code>Noise</code> and <code>Lighting</code>):</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Virtual analogs of real instruments, such as the <strong>\"ASSISTANT\"</strong> sound level meter and the <strong>\"TKA-PKM\"</strong> luxmeter, were recreated from scratch.</li>\n<li><mark>I exactly replicated their interface, functionality, and even timings</mark>, based on real samples and consultations with professors.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>2D Simulation of Complex Systems (<code>Electrical Safety</code>):</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Created an interactive 2D stand emulating the operation of electrical networks, where the student could change circuit parameters and observe the readings of virtual instruments.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Interactive Maps:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Developed a simulator for <strong>assessing the situation after a nuclear explosion</strong>, where all work takes place on a 2D map using interactive tools for building affected zones.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Integration into the Educational Process:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>For all laboratory works, a system for <strong>automatic report generation</strong> was implemented, which the student could download and submit for verification.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Outcome</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Large Commercial Product Created:</strong> Successfully implemented a complex of dozens of laboratory works, which became one of the company's flagship products.</li>\n<li><strong>Exceptional Flexibility Demonstrated:</strong> The project proves my ability to <strong>work with absolutely different types of tasks</strong>: from first-person 3D simulations to 2D schemes and precise equipment emulation.</li>\n<li><strong>Key Competency:</strong> This experience honed my skill to <mark>quickly immerse myself in any, even the most complex subject area, and turn it into a high-quality interactive product</mark>.</li>\n</ul>\n","published":true,"title":"Simulator Complex \"Life Safety (BZD)\"","date":"2019-06","type":"project","tagsArray":["PC","Web","VR","Unity","C#","HLSL"],"heroVideo":["Y54fnmsgB3g","GsFiTdluVnw"],"shortDescription":"<p>Created <strong>dozens of diverse simulators</strong> for an educational complex: from 3D constructors and 2D schematics to real equipment emulation.</p>\n","storeLinks":["https://labstand.ru/catalog/pozharn_bezop"],"role":"team","projectIcon":"/images/projects/19.06.bzd/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/19.06.bzd/card.video?v=1765111473674&webm=1&mp4=1","screenshots":[{"src":"/images/projects/19.06.bzd/screenshots/0.webp","width":1162,"height":914},{"src":"/images/projects/19.06.bzd/screenshots/1.webp","width":1164,"height":914},{"src":"/images/projects/19.06.bzd/screenshots/2.webp","width":1160,"height":914},{"src":"/images/projects/19.06.bzd/screenshots/3.webp","width":1160,"height":914},{"src":"/images/projects/19.06.bzd/screenshots/4.webp","width":1228,"height":914},{"src":"/images/projects/19.06.bzd/screenshots/5.webp","width":1228,"height":914},{"src":"/images/projects/19.06.bzd/screenshots/6.webp","width":1228,"height":914},{"src":"/images/projects/19.06.bzd/screenshots/7.webp","width":1228,"height":914},{"src":"/images/projects/19.06.bzd/screenshots/8.webp","width":1164,"height":914}]}